config BR2_PACKAGE_PARTINIT
	bool "script for partition init"
	help
	  script for partition init: S21mountall.sh (grow, check and mount the
	  partitions), the fstab and the /dev/block/by-name udev rules.

	  (Stock Rockchip made this depend on usbmount, which the Retron SQ
	  firmware doesn't use; with that dependency, removing usbmount
	  silently dropped this package.)
